	<content contentuid="hacdf1a2dgc3b3g400egbbf9g8530289f54f0" version="1">Paralyzing Toxins</content>
	<content contentuid="h6570de61gaa50g487egacf3g6a6b631de163" version="1">A foe who takes &lt;b&gt;primarily&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; from you must succeed on a &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;Constitution&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throw&lt;/LSTag&gt; or be &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PARALYZED"&gt;Paralyzed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;Difficulty Class&lt;/LSTag&gt; is based on your &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;Potency DC&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
